---
source: crates/mailer/tests/snapshots.rs
expression: "format!(\"subject: {}\\n\\n--- text ---\\n{}\\n--- html ---\\n{}\", rendered.subject,\nrendered.text_body, rendered.html_body)"
---
subject: Your Detag account is suspended

--- text ---
Hi,

Your Detag account is suspended for violating our acceptable-use policy.

Reason: repeated stock-agency template matches

While suspended you cannot sign in, your sessions have been signed out, and your queued jobs are on hold. This is the second step of our enforcement ladder: a further violation may lead to termination of your account. If you believe this suspension was made in error, contact support.

— The Detag team

